# Organiser knowledge base

The admin-only guide is `/admin/guide`, written in `src/app/admin/guide/guide-content.tsx`.

When you add, change, or remove a user-facing or organiser feature, update that guide in the same change. Cover what it is, where to find it, and how to use it. Bump `GUIDE_LAST_UPDATED`.

Do not ship a feature the guide still describes the old way, or omit a new organiser workflow from the guide.
